Z||000000||2FAST4U||01-01-2000||09:55 PM||||The ECM to engine wiring harness connector has 5 retainers - 2 on top - 1 on each side -and one in the center. How do you keep the side and top retainers pulled back and the center one pinched in with only two hands. It seems the simplist things on this car cause the most problems. I've built a complete new engine for the car with no problems but can't get the wiring harness disconnected to pull the old engine out. What a pain in the rear!<p>[This message has been edited by 2FAST4U (edited 01-01-2000).]||||reg||8
Z||000001||fiero56||01-01-2000||11:36 PM||||When I do stuff like this, I end up using a handfull of screwdrivers, and a lot of patience. I pry a screw driver under each clip, and gently pull the two pieces apart. The smaller/lighter the screwdrivers the better.||||reg||1
